{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739055402120904784","content":"<@692746345387130900>\n\nYou begin having nightmares\n\nYou are side by side with rooftop gang walking in between tree houses. The bridge is narrow and you naturally have to go from 3 side by side down to only 2. You elect to slow down so your friends can go first and you trail behind. But you begin slowing down too much as you cross the bridge. It begins stretching and they are further and further away. Not even looking back, forgetting about you. Wren doesn't look back... The lines to the bridge start snapping. You are much higher up than you thought. It breaks and you start to fall, but-\n\nA flying Yeti in a Fez catches you and floats you to the other side. Wren kisses you and daysong gives you a hug. A tear comes from his eye as he glances from wren to you. He floats back out over the snapped bridge and begins waving... Fading away as he does so..\n\nYou were cursed by a hag but did not suffer for it because of a great sacrifice. You heal completely and lose any exhaaustion points.","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:33:53.324000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741227608980717638","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
